    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"1188965\">@E_Nava (Lalo)</span> would you mind trying to write you messages here a bit clearer. </p>\n<p>I think you are trying to say: </p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>You have finished a specific theorem about d-dimensional Hilbert spaces including the Robertson-Schrodinger Uncertainty Principle. </p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>If so, we have to be careful here. The example you shared is a discrete Hilbert space (although physically represents a d-dimensional system). What is being discussed in this thread is Infinite dimensional hilbert spaces based off <code>Space d</code>.</p>",
